  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, pca_n2000 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_019) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.639). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a larger, more powerful image encoder) while keeping avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion, to determine if improving the image encoder further boosts performance. This clarifies the importance of image encoder choice, a key design decision, without deviating from the current high-performing pattern."
